{
  "thought_summary": "需要调查 gcd 函数的实现，特别是递归调用中参数缩减逻辑和基条件，以验证是否因参数未正确缩减导致无限递归。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "list_files",
    "arguments": {
      "path": ".",
      "max_depth": 1,
      "max_entries": 100
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "已列出仓库文件，下一步需检查 gcd.py 文件以了解 gcd 函数的实现。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "inspect_code",
    "arguments": {
      "file_path": "gcd.py",
      "start_line": 1,
      "context_lines": 20,
      "max_lines": 50
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "gcd 函数实现使用递归，当 b 不为零时，调用 gcd(a % b, b)。需要验证参数缩减逻辑是否正确，以确认是否因参数未正确缩减导致无限递归。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "search_code",
    "arguments": {
      "query": "gcd",
      "path": "gcd.py",
      "regex": false,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "max_results": 10
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "搜索代码时出现错误，可能路径不正确。需要重新检查 gcd.py 文件内容以确认 gcd 函数的实现。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "inspect_code",
    "arguments": {
      "file_path": "gcd.py",
      "start_line": 1,
      "context_lines": 20,
      "max_lines": 50
    }
  }
}
